recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the wide half is closed and metered; the two that remain are other hands'. The silent pair-gate lowering is Sound's language custody and wants one arm of glow/lower_shop_gate.rye to speak its answer the way .fold_sumto already does; the twenty remaining walls are Tally's, Aurora's and Rishi's, one lane per lap. FORA31's switchboard is Dream's, and Comlink's half of that seam is the next real door in this lane.
